    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆσαι</span></b> , aor. 1
		inf.
		
			Act.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suckle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; elsewh. 
				Med.
			, <i>suck</i>; <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> has pres.
			inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ αἰεὶ παρέχουσιν
				ἐπηετανὸν γάλα θῆσθαι</span> they give milk <i>to
			suck</i> the year round, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.89
			</span></i>: aor. 1, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήσατο
			μαζόν</span> he <i>sucked</i> the breast, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.58
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησάμενος</span>”
				<i>having sucked,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					h.Cer.
					236
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Sos.</u>
				</span></i>
			vii.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>; but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>suckle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλωνα θήσατο μήτηρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					123
				</span></i>
			. (I.-<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>dhē-</i> 'suck', cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλή,
				θῆλυς</span>, Lett. <i>dēt</i> 'suck', Skt.
				<i>dháyati</i>, Goth. <i>daddjan</i> 'suckle',
			Lat. <i>fēlare, filius.</i>)</div>
